  "title": "How to Make Vanilla Ice Cream",
  "description": "Homemade ice cream is easy to make with just 4 ingredients including pure vanilla extract for a rich and creamy treat with a delicious vanilla flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2013-08-12T19:55:06-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-04-01T08:55:46-04:00",
